pinyon-shift-fh1-render-test-v1
# #491 festival pacing: boot the seed into free roam, wait for the vehicle and
# open the pause menu, which shows the balance and driver level, then resume
# and let the title settle. Run once from a seed with festival_pacing enabled
# and once without (PINYON_SHIFT_M5_SAVE_TRACE=1 keeps the loaded and saved
# profile bodies) to compare what an existing save does under the new curves.
input 0 0000 0 0 0 0 0 0
input 360 1000 0 0 0 0 0 0
input 366 0000 0 0 0 0 0 0
input 480 1000 0 0 0 0 0 0
input 486 0000 0 0 0 0 0 0
input 600 1000 0 0 0 0 0 0
input 606 0000 0 0 0 0 0 0
input 720 1000 0 0 0 0 0 0
input 726 0000 0 0 0 0 0 0
wait 1400 3000 vehicle
capture 1560 free-roam
input 1620 0010 0 0 0 0 0 0
input 1626 0000 0 0 0 0 0 0
capture 1740 pause
input 1800 2000 0 0 0 0 0 0
input 1806 0000 0 0 0 0 0 0
capture 1920 resumed
stop 2400
